---
// BentoExperienceV2.astro - Athletic Bento Grid with Real Instagram Imagery and Club Data
---

<section id="experiencia" class="py-20 lg:py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-[#03131e] relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    
    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div data-section-heading class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-500/15 border border-teal-400/30 text-teal-300 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        <span>POR QUÉ DOMUS ES DIFERENTE</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-athletic text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        LA EXPERIENCIA <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-300 via-teal-400 to-cyan-200">DOMUS VOLEY</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="font-sans text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Competimos en la Liga de Miraflores, entrenamos en canchas reglamentarias de Jesús María y formamos deportistas con valores, técnica federada y preparación física real.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid Container -->
    <div data-reveal-stagger class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5 sm:gap-6">
      
      <!-- Bento Item 1: Competencia Oficial en Liga de Miraflores (Large 8 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden min-h-[300px] sm:min-h-[440px] flex flex-col justify-end p-5 sm:p-10 border border-teal-500/20 group shadow-2xl">
        <img 
          src="/images/instagram/ig-post-10.jpg" 
          alt="Campeonas y Medallas Domus Voley en Liga Distrital de Miraflores FPV IPD" 
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 filter brightness-90"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#03131e] via-[#03131e]/75 to-transparent"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-600 text-white text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5 sm:mb-3 shadow-md shadow-teal-600/30">
            <span>AFILIADOS FPV & IPD</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-athletic text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-2 sm:mb-3">
            Competimos en la Liga de Miraflores
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-base text-slate-200 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Nuestros deportistas no solo practican: compiten oficialmente en torneos federados de la Federación Peruana de Voleibol (FPV), acumulando trofeos, medallas y roce deportivo genuino.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 2: Sedes Oficiales en Jesús María (4 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-8 bg-[#041a29] border border-teal-500/20 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-teal-400/50 transition-colors shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-36 h-36 bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-teal-500/20 transition-all"></div>
        
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-2xl bg-teal-500/20 border border-teal-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-teal-300 mb-4 sm:mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 sm:w-6 sm:h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-teal-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-sans block mb-1">
            2 SEDES EN JESÚS MARÍA
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-athletic text-xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-2 sm:mb-3">
            Fanning & Joseph and Mary
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 font-sans leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Av. Arnaldo Márquez 551, Jesús María. Canchas reglamentarias con techo protector, piso deportivo de alta fricción, iluminación nocturna y seguridad integral.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-teal-500/15 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">Av. Arnaldo Márquez 551</span>
          <a 
            href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Av.+Arnaldo+Márquez+551+Jesus+Maria+Lima" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-bold text-teal-400 hover:text-teal-300 flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer"
          >
            <span>Ver mapa</span>
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 3: Entrenador Internacional Germán Félix (4 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden min-h-[260px] sm:min-h-[340px] flex flex-col justify-end p-5 sm:p-8 border border-teal-500/20 group shadow-2xl">
        <img 
          src="/images/instagram/ig-post-4.jpg" 
          alt="Germán Félix Entrenador Internacional República Dominicana Domus Voley" 
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 filter brightness-90"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#03131e] via-[#03131e]/75 to-transparent"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-sans block mb-1">
            STAFF INTERNACIONAL 🇩🇴
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-athletic text-xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">
            Prof. Germán Félix
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Entrenador de trayectoria internacional y técnicos federados COPEV: <em>"El talento se trabaja, el equipo se construye."</em>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 4: Preparación Física Especializada (4 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden min-h-[260px] sm:min-h-[340px] flex flex-col justify-end p-5 sm:p-8 border border-teal-500/20 group shadow-2xl">
        <img 
          src="/images/instagram/ig-post-7.jpg" 
          alt="Entrenamiento de preparación física en Domus Voley" 
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 filter brightness-85"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#03131e] via-[#03131e]/75 to-transparent"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-teal-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-sans block mb-1">
            ACONDICIONAMIENTO FÍSICO
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-athletic text-xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">
            Fuerza, Salto & Prevención
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Más fuerza para saltar, más velocidad de reacción y ejercicios de pliometría que blindan articulaciones contra lesiones.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 5: Comunidad y Familia DVC (4 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden min-h-[260px] sm:min-h-[340px] flex flex-col justify-end p-5 sm:p-8 border border-teal-500/20 group shadow-2xl">
        <img 
          src="/images/instagram/ig-post-11.jpg" 
          alt="Comunidad y familia Domus Voleibol Club" 
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 filter brightness-90"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#03131e] via-[#03131e]/75 to-transparent"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-sans block mb-1">
            +8,600 EN INSTAGRAM
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-athletic text-xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tight mb-1.5 sm:mb-2">
            Más que un Club, una Familia
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Salidas de integración, campeonatos de confraternidad y una sólida comunidad deportiva activa en redes sociales.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
